      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_3_0fbc74f",
      "source": "Daughter: Или просто уйти искать меня.",
      "target": "Daughter: Vagy egyszerűen elindulhatott megkeresni engem.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9910,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454543974400",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_3_030a122",
      "source": "Daughter: Значит… значит он и потушить пожар мог.",
      "target": "Daughter: Akkor… akkor a tüzet is el tudta oltani.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9911,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454539780107",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_3_007bd0d",
      "source": "Daughter: Папу стукнули, но он потом встал, я видела такое.",
      "target": "Daughter: Apát megütötték, de aztán felkelt. Láttam.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9912,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454539780106",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_3_0359aaa",
      "source": "Daughter: Я не уверена.",
      "target": "Daughter: Nem vagyok biztos benne.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9913,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454539780105",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_3_0f75b22",
      "source": "Daughter: Я не знаю.",
      "target": "Daughter: Nem tudom.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9914,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454539780104",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_2_066a8ba",
      "source": "Тебе лучше пока побыть здесь",
      "target": "Jobb, ha egyelőre itt maradsz.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9915,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454539780103",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_2_0a93e6b",
      "source": "Ты же видела, что произошло",
      "target": "Hiszen láttad, mi történt.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9916,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454539780102",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_2_0203896",
      "source": "Daughter: А кто-нибудь остался у нас ещё?",
      "target": "Daughter: Maradt még valaki közülünk?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9917,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454539780101",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_2_0d9780f",
      "source": "Daughter: Мама не приедет за нами?",
      "target": "Daughter: Anya nem jön értünk?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9918,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454539780100",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_2_0b01cfb",
      "source": "Daughter: …",
      "target": "Daughter: …",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-038.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9919,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454539780099",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_2_0a463f1",
      "source": "Daughter: А моя комната? Она тоже сгорела?",
      "target": "Daughter: És a szobám? Az is leégett?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9920,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454539780098",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_2_0aca8d9",
      "source": "Daughter: Но с папой всё в порядке?",
      "target": "Daughter: De apával minden rendben?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9921,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454539780097",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_1_0e95e8f",
      "source": "Тебе лучше пока побыть здесь",
      "target": "Jobb, ha egyelőre itt maradsz.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9922,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454539780096",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_1_092a92e",
      "source": "Ты же видела, что произошло",
      "target": "Hiszen láttad, mi történt.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
