      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454535585803",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_1_02791b7",
      "source": "Daughter: Значит, папа всё-таки придёт за мной, да?",
      "target": "Daughter: Akkor apa mégis eljön értem, ugye?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9924,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454535585802",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_1_0e82871",
      "source": "Daughter: Мне сделают новую комнату?",
      "target": "Daughter: Csinálnak nekem új szobát?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9925,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454535585801",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_1_0268520",
      "source": "Daughter: Или в тот же?",
      "target": "Daughter: Vagy ugyanabba a házba?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9926,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454535585800",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_1_03f4a2b",
      "source": "Daughter: И заберут в новый дом?",
      "target": "Daughter: És elvisznek az új házba?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9927,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454535585799",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_1_0c79c6c",
      "source": "Daughter: Хорошо. Значит, скоро за мной придут?",
      "target": "Daughter: Jó. Akkor hamarosan jönnek értem?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9928,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454535585798",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_077021d",
      "source": "Нескоро. Ваш дом сгорел",
      "target": "Nem mostanában. Leégett a házatok.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9929,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454535585797",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_06fdee5",
      "source": "Позже, там ремонт",
      "target": "Később. Felújítják.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9930,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454535585796",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_0e20e34",
      "source": "Daughter: Когда можно будет пойти домой?",
      "target": "Daughter: Mikor mehetek haza?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9931,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454535585795",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_0e6feb0",
      "source": "Daughter: Я бы хотела домой…",
      "target": "Daughter: Haza szeretnék menni…",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9932,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454535585794",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_2_099a581",
      "source": "Daughter: Неплохо тут.",
      "target": "Daughter: Egész jó itt.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9933,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454535585793",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:talk_daughter_2_0806863",
      "source": "Мне надо тебя проверить",
      "target": "Meg kell vizsgálnom téged",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9934,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454535585792",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:talk_daughter_2_07e7aa4",
      "source": "Ты как? Нравится тебе здесь?",
      "target": "Hogy vagy? Tetszik itt?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9935,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454531391500",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:talk_daughter_2_07279f7",
      "source": "Daughter: Я... Я хо-чу к ма-ме.",
      "target": "Daughter: Én... én a-anyához aka-rok menni.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9936,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454531391499",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_1_2_0f4c95e",
      "source": "Daughter: (Девочка даже не слышит вас. В своём горе она одна)",
      "target": "Daughter: (A kislány meg sem hallja önt. Egyedül van a gyászával.)",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9937,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454531391498",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_1_1_0e0277d",
      "source": "Daughter: (Девочка безостановочно зовёт отца, истерика остановится нескоро)",
      "target": "Daughter: (A kislány megállás nélkül az apját kiáltja. A hisztériás rohama nem fog hamar elmúlni.)",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9938,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454531391497",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_1_09af116",
      "source": "Я ещё завтра с тобой поговорю, хорошо?",
      "target": "Holnap még beszélek veled, jó?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9939,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454531391496",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_1_00eb9e3",
      "source": "Ты… отдыхай пока",
      "target": "Te… most pihenj.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-314.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9940,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454531391495",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Daughter_Asking_1_02f2cd5",
      "source": "Daughter: ПА-А-А-АПА-А-А!",
      "target": "Daughter: APÁÁÁ-ÁÁÁ!",
